TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 369425647}
  m_Text: 'FACILITIES - SIGN LETTERS


    The supplier has again sent capital O''s

    in place of zeros. We have checked, and

    as far as the building is concerned

    they are the same thing. They will be

    used as zeros until further notice.


    W. Brisk, Facilities'
  m_OffsetZ: 0
  m_CharacterSize: 0.013888889
