  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Kit.Gameplay::Kit.Gameplay.Signage.WorldText
  text: 'LOST PROPERTY


    Umbrella, black, bamboo handle

    (lobby, 14 Feb)

    One glove, tan, left

    Reading glasses, green case

    Key on a blue tag marked B

    Cardigan, oatmeal (L3)


    Held at the cloakroom 30 days,

    then to Facilities.

    - W. Brisk, Front Desk'
  letterHeight: 0.017
  style: 0
  anchor: 4
